        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "VAUDEVILLE RETURNS!  It’s a summer tradition at the Empress. Each year locals from Fort Macleod and surrounding area show their stuff on the Empress stage.&nbsp; Singing, dancing, comedy, skits - you never know what you might see and who you might see.&nbsp; Who knew your neighbours&nbsp"
