      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Join us for this bigger than life artist as he tours his Xmas show across the country. When Matt Andersen steps on stage, he brings a lifetime of music to every note he plays. Matt Andersen’s stage presence is informed by decades of cutting his teeth in dusty clubs, dim-lit bars, and grand theatres"
      }
