        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "The Empress Theatre presents this classic, award winning musical.  The Music Man is the story of con man Harold Hill, who poses as a boys' band organizer and leader and sells band instruments and uniforms to naïve Midwestern townsfolk, promising to train the members of the new band. Harold is no mus"
