      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Drag Out the Love is back with 13 performers from across Alberta to amplify&nbsp;2SLGBTQ+ voices and promote empathy and understanding in our community. Our identities and art are not illegal. Join us in solidarity and celebration on August 26th, 2023 for Drag Out The Love: Not Guilty."
