      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Pavlo, the internationally renowned, award-winning recording artist, performer and songwriter, has released 15 albums and include 4 PBS TV concert specials. Born in Toronto to Greek parents, Pavlo has made a name for himself with a Mediterranean blend of Greek, flamenco, Latin, and Balkan flavours,"
      }
