      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Opening the 2022-2023 Centre Stage Series is Bow Vallet based The Wardens. The Rocky Mountain based band stories and songs rise from the very land they've protected as Canadian National Park wardens. With haunting three-part harmonies and chilling tales, the band’s mountain music - blending, folk ro"
