    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "He can come at his audience like a runaway rig, while firing off image bound lyrics with the marksmanship of a western gunslinger. Tim Hus will make you sit up and pay attention to his songs, story songs that capture the pioneering spirit that motivates and inspires truck drivers, miners, rum runner"
