      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Showcasing the very best paddling films, the festival screens in more than 135 cities around the world each year. Join us for this year's best paddling films. You'll be inspired to explore rivers, lakes and oceans, push extremes, embrace the paddling lifestyle and appreciate the wild places."
      }
