    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "JUNO Award winning duo Whitehorse return to the early days of electric blues. Take a trip through 1950s blues bops with The Northern South Vol. 2., the second instalment of a project that melds the grooves and melodies of the original selections with the band’s steamy, swampy, squalling approach."
