        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Valdy, is a Canadian folk and country music legend who has toured for forty-six years. HIs solo career began in the early 1970s. He is most known for \"Rock and Roll Song\", his first mainstream single but Valdy has a treasure trove of songs and stories.  He is the winner of two JUNO awards"
