    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-gb",
        "@value": "Campers will explore the topsy-turvy world of Wonderland.&nbsp; The weeklong day camp is full of theatre games, character building, silly scenes and costuming – all leading up to a delightful showcase for family, friends and the community of Fort MacLeod. Whether your child is bold and dramatic"
